<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soviel</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">imer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear>, und mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verschonung</unclear> weniger
