<lb n="42"/>nicht.
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sonsten</unclear> haben wir der 1000. reueter und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anders</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">volcks</unclear> halben, so auß <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-446" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Niderland</placeName>, inß <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-170" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Elsaeß</placeName>
