<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohngewisse</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">relationes</unclear> einbringen:
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> dem etliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermelden</unclear>, das solche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reuetter</unclear>
